    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Upon reaching 10th level, you find solace and empowerment in the goddess Elune, you gain the following features.</p><ul><li><p>You gain resistance to radiant damage.</p></li><li><p>You can choose to deal radiant damage with your Force of Nature feature, rather than the spell's damage type.</p></li><li><p>You have advantage on checks and saving throws to avoid being charmed or frightened by spell effects.</p></li></ul>",
